","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7e78-b155-2280008beda0","description":"A pride","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7f09-a1aa-38e81730b7d7","description":"A sedge","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7dc3-9ae4-0be1eea3cb9c","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is Selenology the study of?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Selenology studies the moon\u2019s surface, composition, and geological history. The name comes from Selene, the Greek personification of the moon.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7753-a887-acf29c71829f","description":"The moon","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7d11-a2cf-87230f6185fe","description":"Tax","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7913-a82f-6e22b752ebbd","description":"Heat","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7877-a0e2-c7baeadd84e5","description":"Interactions between siblings","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7fd4-9cce-7aa60fd4c78d","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is Trichology the study of?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Trichology focuses on hair and scalp health, including issues such as hair loss and dandruff.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad59-79af-bc55-a02aebd9bfc0","description":"hair and scalp","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-775d-a450-77d20d0e52b7","description":"angels","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-73bf-a895-44b56f67ed90","description":"the ecology of plant communities","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7b38-bd00-1f7eaf83aea2","description":"sleep","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad59-7037-9443-b31186fddd85","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which French physicist discovered radioactivity while studying uranium salts?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Henri Becquerel found that uranium compounds spontaneously emitted penetrating radiation. He shared the 1903 Nobel Prize in Physics with Marie and Pierre Curie."